{"ts":"2026-09-13T06:24:16.685Z","event":"decision","ticket":null,"session_id":null,"job":null,"payload":{"ticket":null,"answer":"Q1 What does the goal become, given that no model can reach 0.85 AUROC on split_b at the generator defaults? Answer: the +0.02 gain over the no-product logistic regression: at least +0.02 held-out AUROC on split_b, mean over seeds","decided_by":"human","rationale":"the owner: I care about the gain, not an absolute number I picked before anyone ran the generator","confidence":0.95}}
{"ts":"2026-09-13T06:24:17.920Z","event":"decision","ticket":null,"session_id":null,"job":null,"payload":{"ticket":null,"answer":"Q2 Which of the position memo's directions does the project take? Answer: moderate: nearest plus a flexible model without products as a second baseline","decided_by":"human","rationale":"the owner took the recommendation: the radius is moderate, and only the moderate direction answers objection 2, paper-b's flexible model finding interactions without products","confidence":null}}
{"ts":"2026-09-13T06:24:19.108Z","event":"decision","ticket":null,"session_id":null,"job":null,"payload":{"ticket":null,"answer":"Q3 scikit-learn is not installed: what fits the models? Answer: install scikit-learn, but into a virtual environment of the project's own, not the tools venv","decided_by":"human","rationale":"the owner: the tools venv is for the PDF converters and I want it left alone","confidence":null}}
{"ts":"2026-09-13T06:24:20.733Z","event":"decision","ticket":null,"session_id":null,"job":null,"payload":{"ticket":null,"answer":"Q4 Which interaction terms does the with-products model get? Answer: all 28 pairwise products of x0..x7, with the planted-only model (x2*x3) as an oracle reference, and no coefficient read as a discovery","decided_by":"human","rationale":"the owner took the recommendation: the method cannot know which product was planted, the planted-only model bounds what a product can add, and reading no coefficient as a discovery meets objection 4","confidence":null}}
{"ts":"2026-09-13T06:24:21.724Z","event":"decision","ticket":null,"session_id":null,"job":null,"payload":{"ticket":null,"answer":"Q6 What wall-clock budget does the project run under? Answer: 4 hours of CPU wall clock in total","decided_by":"human","rationale":"the owner: a one-hour cap would kill the network's cross-validation grid halfway through","confidence":null}}
